{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53449","headline":"洗鉢潭 · 邢允中","name":"洗鉢潭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"潭水澄初地，长爲洗鉢供。\n已能降虎豹，不问揽鱼龙。\n溅沫溪莎碧，疏流石濑重。\n此中清净理，继迹有禅宗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邢允中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53449.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53449","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}